 </div>


<h3 style="font-weight:bold; color:#007bff;">SUMMARY</h3>


<div style="margin-bottom:15px;">


      Ben Thanh Market is a cultural, commercial, and tourist symbol of Ho Chi Minh City, nổi bật with a prominent French colonial and East Asian architectural style. It is a place for economic and cultural exchange and preserves the traditional lifestyle of the Saigon people.


    </div>


